ans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Sp7lWesudZDJpEbxUWBribqyJINxCsOTLibia7Gm03ljhzO5O2ONdamJJcSauBj74Sw5rlbqaobaB0A/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"width: 578px;height: 811px;\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于水洗批次\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          本批次来自于Elida的Torre地块，海拔1800米左右，也是艾力达之前BOP屡次获奖的地块，水洗采用“small hand”，分多次每次少批量的水洗，得到更为精致干净一致的水洗批次。\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SnlODiaTrnTuwU9kZrhghs3GiaA4SENG1b6ha20QKPvOBwyyJJ75fCDknme2JvETaee3sZQOJb00dg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于厌氧日晒缓慢干燥批次\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          厌氧日晒采用的是144小时鲜果密封厌氧发酵，然后转移到晒棚下缓慢干燥。\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Sp7lWesudZDJpEbxUWBribqCpiad6x7qOfpBBcnBsvf7QibicQqpXFazJlgvb2iagaIefWhm4Ej7YVJRQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong style='max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;color: rgb(178, 178, 178);box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n            以下资料来自台湾守成 Haru Coffee\n           </span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;border-width: 0px;border-style: initial;border-color: initial;font-family: inherit;font-style: inherit;font-variant-caps: inherit;font-weight: 700;font-stretch: inherit;line-height: inherit;vertical-align: baseline;color: rgb(50, 50, 50);font-size: 14px;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          巴拿馬 拉馬斯特家族　Panama Lamastus Family Estates\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          位於巴拿馬，坐落於知名精品咖啡產區波魁特內的Lamastus家族，旗下分別有艾利達莊園(Elida Estate)、驢子莊園(El Burro Estate)以及路易多莊園(Luito Gesha Estate)三個帶有各自特色莊園，目前由第三以及第四代莊園主Wilford Lamastus和Wilford Lamastus Jr.所經營，Lamastus家族的咖啡世代至今已有百年的傳承。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SnlODiaTrnTuwU9kZrhghs3UQsYs9nmfQvOwXxfm7MsnIqLLgoOFUTvb1Uf4tyAN3Um2wpr1J9Q9A/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          Wilford分享能夠產出品質卓越的超級精品咖啡，要歸功於以下的先天優越條件:\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          1.肥沃的火山土壤\n         </span>\n<br style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          2.微氣候天氣變化\n         </span>\n<br style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          3.高海拔種植環境\n         </span>\n<br style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          4.優良的原始森林\n         </span>\n<br style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          5.極具特色微批次\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;border-width: 0px;border-style: initial;border-color: initial;font-family: inherit;font-style: inherit;font-variant-caps: inherit;font-weight: 700;font-stretch: inherit;line-height: inherit;vertical-align: baseline;color: rgb(50, 50, 50);font-size: 14px;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          巴拿馬 艾利達莊園　Panama Elida Estate\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          艾利達莊園(Elida Estate)海拔高度相當高，我們所採購的批次平均約落在1700~1800m之間，艾利達莊園本身就在國家公園保留區內，莊園內一直保持著非常原始的林相，同時也保留許多原生樹種和可供食用的番茄、梅果樹。艾利達莊園內由於環境保護的關係，因此並未鋪設柏油路面，坐著莊園主Wilford的4X4越野車開在莊園內，隨著海拔越來越高，氣溫降低的幅度非常明顯，而低溫涼爽的氣溫加上遮蔭樹的保護也提供咖啡樹相當好的栽種環境。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SnlODiaTrnTuwU9kZrhghs3TdK9EIcK3Aneq4kJVCKoMiau1iaicQ0dbuMJTGq2EicE11SNCRSr1nOIFA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          除了對於莊園環境的嚴格維護之外，Wilford也實驗了相當多種的日曬方式，有傳統日曬棚架、現代化棚架、庭院式曝曬、遮蔽式乾燥以及機械式乾燥，在日曬乾燥的階段，Wilford都要求員工手选仔細挑除不夠好的瑕疵豆，此外在批次上艾利達莊園也劃分的相當仔細，每一批從莊園採收下來的紅果都會填上不同編號，方便後續杯測階段追蹤批次品質和風味水準。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SnlODiaTrnTuwU9kZrhghs3R68Y6Dy4FhP8lgx1PjaRXeAV8D65zmEkBlSZxlAGUdC6eVkxcfuQ2g/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           获奖记录\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          2016 BOP #1\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          2018 BOP #1\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          2019 BOP #1\n          <br/>\n          2020 BOP 日晒组 #6, #9\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          2020 BOP 水洗组 #2\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style='max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          更多咖啡豆采购，请到淘宝或者有赞小程序\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          咖啡豆信息请参阅公众号文章菜单\n          <br style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Q09FO8svc4MbsT6kYe0icjVt0iafAKEvQb4V0sg5ELeaSJuChicNO6jr9zxGVFVu7wDwt3ibVQgXa5ow/640?wx_fmt=png\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;width: 677px !important;visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</p>\n</div>",
